      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あなたたち、メルセデス海賊団ですか？\r\n少しお話があるのですが……",
        "official_en": "Are you with the Mercedes Pirates? I come with no ill intentions. If you’ll allow me to talk with your captain—",
        "real_en": "Are you the Mercedes Pirates? I'd like to talk to you about something..."
      },
