        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_02:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_02_001:a9dcaade",
        "jp_sha256": "c4c6b28762d25b6994794d4ba377081dc39f7851485b421c6de4e78b4481533e",
        "official_en_sha256": "8b72d1f6697e6fa7d8d3b7e9e1e2127cffeb129518233d9be53de6eb5f4318ad"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おい、一体なんの用事だ？\r\nこの先には、\r\n俺たちの船が泊まっているだけだぜ。",
        "official_en": "Avast, I say, avast! Whatever yer lookin’ for, it sure as hell ain’t here... Only thing on this jetty’s our ship.",
        "real_en": "Hey, what do you want? The only thing farther down this jetty is our ship."
      },
