        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_02:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_02_008:d7b8fa94",
        "jp_sha256": "ef2c3871773b49b88b33e6929338485d58a65e6057152c024637efd31eafe00d",
        "official_en_sha256": "05d610bf7a63815e20b104e81c19bc52fba3e84fa500fa8eec92c21f59b9c914"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここで逃がすと後々厄介なことになりそうです。\r\n船を出される前に、手を打ちましょう。",
        "official_en": "We should settle this matter before they can escape. If we let them flee here, there is no telling when another opportunity to talk to them will present itself.",
        "real_en": "If we let them escape now, they might cause trouble later. Let’s act before they set sail."
      },
