      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ちっ……。\r\nまさか、守り人さんが出てくるとはな……",
        "official_en": "Ugh... Wasn’t expectin’ a Warden to show up...",
        "real_en": "Tch...\r\nNever thought a Warden would show up..."
      },
