        "official_en_sha256": "7f99b5cd0c5a1ca11915255d0783071816d8fcc3b642c374caec69d10f2c74d5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "怪我をしたくないなら、\r\nさっさと引き返すんだな。",
        "official_en": "So unless yer hankerin’ for some spankerin’, I suggest you turn tail and mosey on back to wherever ya came from.",
        "real_en": "If you don't want to get hurt, turn around and head back."
      },
