      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "船長に報告して、船でずらかるぞ。",
        "official_en": "Gotta let Cap’n know that we need to weigh anchor and get the hell outta here!",
        "real_en": "We'd better tell the captain and get out of here on the ship."
      },
