      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "誰かと思えば……守り人さんじゃねえか。\r\n悪いが、こっちには話すことなんかないぜ？",
        "official_en": "Now wait a damn moment, you a Warden? Ya can forget about talkin’ to our cap’n.",
        "real_en": "Well, well... if it isn't the Warden.\r\nSorry, but we've got nothin' to say to you."
      },
